    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Earth receives sunlight over a disc (area <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi R^2\"></span>), but radiates over its sphere (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\\pi R^2\"></span>). [1 mark]<br/>Average intensity = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\dfrac{S}{4}\"></span>. [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I = \\dfrac{1370 \\cdot (1 - 0.3)}{4} = 239.75 \\approx 240,\\text{W m}^{-2}\"></span><br/>Correct expression. [1 mark]<br/>Correct answer. [1 mark]</p></section>"
